    "body": "Missing or damaged teeth affect far more than your appearance, they change how you chew, how you speak, and how you feel about yourself. Custom dental prostheses restore all three, rebuilding function, comfort and a harmonious smile. At Dental Med Austria in Tirana we design fixed and removable prostheses, custom dentures and full-mouth rehabilitations, often anchored on implants for added stability, so your new teeth feel secure and natural every day.\n\n## Fixed or removable: which prosthesis suits you?\n\nNo two mouths are alike, which is why every prosthesis we make begins with a careful clinical assessment rather than an off-the-shelf solution. Broadly, your options fall into two families, and many patients combine them within a wider treatment plan.\n\n### Fixed prostheses\n\nFixed prostheses, crowns and bridges, stay permanently in place, so they feel and function closest to natural teeth. They suit patients who want to forget the prosthesis is there at all, and they can be anchored on your own teeth or on implants.\n\n### Removable prostheses and custom dentures\n\nCustom dentures replace several teeth or a full arch and can be taken out for cleaning. Because each one is designed and fitted individually, a well-made denture should sit comfortably and securely, never loose, never an afterthought. You can explore all restorative options in our [treatment catalogue](/en/catalogue).\n\n![Custom dentures resting on a clinical surface](/images/dma/blog/dentures.jpg \"Custom dentures are designed and fitted individually at Dental Med Austria in Tirana.\")\n\n## Designed, milled and finished under one roof\n\nComfort begins long before the fitting appointment. We plan complex cases with Vatech 3D CBCT imaging, and every prosthesis is produced in our in-house iMES iCORE CAD/CAM milling laboratory, with zero outsourcing. The technicians shaping your new teeth work alongside the clinicians who examined you.\n\nWe work only with premium ceramics: Ivoclar IPS e.max and zirconia, chosen for their strength and for the lifelike translucency that lets a prosthesis blend seamlessly into your smile.\n\n> Expert tip: before choosing any clinic, ask where its laboratory actually is. In-house production means faster adjustments and complete quality control from first scan to final fit.\n\n![Ceramic prosthesis work in the dental laboratory](/images/dma/interiors/lab-detail-2.jpg \"Ceramic work in progress at Dental Med Austria's in-house laboratory in Tirana.\")\n\n## Implant-supported stability and full-mouth rehabilitation\n\nFor patients missing many or all of their teeth, combining a prosthesis with dental implants delivers the most stable, long-lasting result. Our team has placed 42,000+ implants with a 98% success rate, using trusted systems such as Straumann BLX, ETK/ETK, Alpha-Bio and Biodem. Every implant comes with the manufacturer's implant passport with verifiable serial numbers, and a lifetime warranty. Full-mouth rehabilitation brings all of this together in one coordinated plan, restoring an entire smile stage by stage.\n\n## 5 questions to ask before choosing a prosthesis clinic\n\n1. Where is the prosthesis made: an in-house laboratory means zero outsourcing, direct communication between dentist and technician, and full control over quality.\n2. Which materials will be used: at Dental Med Austria we work with Ivoclar IPS e.max and zirconia ceramics.\n3. What guarantee covers the work: we back crowns and treatment with a written treatment guarantee, and dental implants with a lifetime warranty.\n4. How is hygiene managed: look for ISO 9001 quality management, European hygiene protocols and rigorous sterilisation.\n5. Can the team speak your language: our staff communicate in English, Italian, German, French, Albanian and many more, and the clinic can arrange an interpreter specifically for your language, so nothing is lost in translation.\n\n## Travelling to Tirana for your new smile\n\nFounded in 2009, our clinic has welcomed 24,000+ happy patients from Albania and abroad. If you are coming from another country, we make the journey simple: airport pickup in Tirana, partner hotels, and [dental travel packages](/en/packets) that organise your stay around your treatment. After your fitting, our [aftercare guides](/en/care) help you keep your prosthesis in perfect condition.\n\n> Send us a panoramic X-ray or a few photos and you will receive a free remote treatment plan within 24-48 hours, before you book anything.\n\n## Restore your smile with confidence\n\nA well-made prosthesis gives you back the everyday things: chewing without hesitation, speaking clearly, smiling freely. With advanced technology, premium materials and our written treatment guarantee, Dental Med Austria offers premium-quality dentistry in Albania. Request your free personalised treatment plan today, simply [contact our team](/en/contact) or email info@dentalmedaustria.com and we will reply within 24-48 hours.",
